e inline panel was **unreachable** â€” `laneTileClick` swallowed clicks on the effort/`<a>` body, and `openPanel` early-returned for any session not in `MANAGED` (live terminals only), i.e. every historical/discovered session. **Why the v4 gate missed it:** the UI \"tests\" were string-greps (asserted `lane-tile`/`panel-stack`/`openPanel` existed in CSS/JS; `termwin` absent) â€” they never asserted the RENDERED BODY became Paradigm 2, that the old kanban was REMOVED, or that a click OPENS a panel. No incognito/visual check.\n85\t\n86\t**Fix (branch `foreman/rnd-v4.1-cockpit`):** rewrote `_render_kanban_html` (â†’ `.p2lanes`/5Ã—`.p2col`, old `.kan`/`.col-cards` removed), `_render_lane_sessions`/`_render_lane_tile` (genuine Paradigm-2 `.tile` schema; no report links/summary accordions/files expanders on the tile; previous sessions as tiles), added `_render_deliverable_lane_tiles` (launch-by-type); fixed `laneTileClick` (reaches `openPanel`) and `openPanel` (accepts historical/discovered/imported ids â€” synthesizes a panel record, renders the split summary from `session_summary` + `session_doc_roles`, read-only body for done sessions / live xterm for running); CSS â†’ mockup tile rules. `_render_effort_card` retired from the lane (kept for other routes).\n87\t\n88\t**HARDENED, un-gameable gate (`tests/test_cockpit_paradigm2.py`, authored by the orchestrator):** DOM-parsed (style/script stripped) structural assertions â€” positive (lane board IS `.p2lanes`/5 `.p2col` with `.tile` schema) + negative (`_assert_no_old_lane_markers`: no `kan`/`col-cards`/`effort`/`session-summary-link`/`openReport`/`termwin` in the body) on multi-lane, **zero-session**, and **imported-only** projects; plus a **real Playwright + Chromium** test that clicks a HISTORICAL tile and asserts the inline panel opens AND populates (â‰¥1 real `.slinks` doc link) with **no JS console errors**. Playwright is a dev-only test dep (`pytest.importorskip`), not shipped â€” distro scan unaffected.\n89\t\n90\